  "review": "<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【2026】シルバーウィーク新幹線割引＆えきねっとトクだ値で行くおすすめ温泉宿比較！越後湯沢・上諏訪・定山渓</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-6 p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-50 via-amber-50/40 to-stone-50 border border-sky-200 rounded-3xl shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-sky-950 flex items-center gap-2\">🚅 新幹線早割（トクだ値・EX早特）×駅近・送迎付き温泉宿で渋滞知らずの秋旅</h3>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">シルバーウィークの高速道路渋滞を回避するなら新幹線移動が最適。乗車日の1ヶ月前〜14日前に発売される「トクだ値（最大30〜50%OFF）」や「EX早特」を活用し、新幹線駅から徒歩すぐまたは専用無料送迎バスがある名湯宿を予約するのが賢い選択です。</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-2 my-6 flex items-center gap-2\">🏆 新幹線割引と相性抜群の厳選名宿</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第1位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">越後湯沢温泉　湯沢グランドホテル＜新潟県＞</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.55</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/38764/38764.jpg\" alt=\"越後湯沢温泉　湯沢グランドホテル＜新潟県＞ 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 【上越新幹線 越後湯沢駅徒歩3分】庭園露天風呂と新潟の地酒バー＆魚沼コシヒカリ</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">東京駅から上越新幹線で最速70分。改札を出て徒歩3分の圧倒的アクセス。四季の日本庭園露天風呂や、新潟の地酒飲み比べカウンター、炊きたて魚沼産コシヒカリ会席が絶賛されています。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>新幹線旅行派、ご夫婦、シニア、駅近で名湯と地酒を満喫したい人</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>新幹線駅徒歩3分の最強立地と極上魚沼会席なら迷わずここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D38764\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】越後湯沢温泉　湯沢グランドホテル＜新潟県＞ の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第2位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">信州上諏訪温泉　諏訪別邸　朱白（旧　双泉の宿　朱白）</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.43</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/52948/52948.jpg\" alt=\"信州上諏訪温泉　諏訪別邸　朱白（旧　双泉の宿　朱白） 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 【特急あずさ 上諏訪駅徒歩8分】諏訪湖一望の展望露天風呂と諏訪五蔵の銘酒</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">新宿駅から特急あずさで直行。諏訪湖畔に佇み、茶褐色と透明の2つの自家源泉を完備。諏訪五蔵の銘酒利き酒と信州牛会席が人気です。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>カップル、ご夫婦、電車で信州の美景と美酒を楽しみたい人</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>諏訪湖パノラマ露天風呂と諏訪五蔵の地酒ならここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D52948\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】信州上諏訪温泉　諏訪別邸　朱白（旧　双泉の宿　朱白） の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第3位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">定山渓万世閣ホテルミリオーネ</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.12</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/20619/20619.jpg\" alt=\"定山渓万世閣ホテルミリオーネ 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 【JR札幌駅より無料送迎バス直行】定山渓温泉の紅葉渓谷と5つの大浴場ビュッフェ</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">新千歳空港から快速エアポートで札幌駅へ、札幌駅前から専用無料送迎バスで直行。紅葉に包まれる露天風呂や窯焼きピザバイキングが好評。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>ファミリー、三世代、北海道の秋旅を満喫したい人</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>札幌駅直結無料シャトルと定山渓の紅葉温泉ならここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D20619\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】定山渓万世閣ホテルミリオーネ の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>"
